WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.629 --> 00:00:03.300
You think you can fix me

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.879
Jean you are not broken

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:11.900
'This is the end beautiful friend'

00:00:12.914 --> 00:00:17.430
the mind is a fragile thing takes only the slightest tap to tip it in the wrong direction

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.430
'This is the end'

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:22.240
Charles

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.257
What did you do?

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.800
I had to keep it stable

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.228
I protected her

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.000
from the truth

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.200
There's another word for that.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.120
I came looking for answers

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:48.567
You feel like you don't belong here

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:49.189
You don't.

00:00:50.699 --> 00:00:54.349
They can't begin to comprehend what you are

00:00:55.649 --> 00:00:57.400
She's changing

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.600
That's what

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.000
You didn't come here looking for answers

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.000
You came here looking for permission.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.000
Jean

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:12.050
She's all but arranged.

00:01:14.729 --> 00:01:16.700
Pain

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:17.989
This war's coming out of us

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.720
Jean lost control but she still our friend?

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.730
This is your fault Charles

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:29.219
The world is on the brink, I'm sorry. I didn't stop it sooner

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:34.710
You're always sorry Charles and there's always a speech and nobody cares

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:38.190
there's still hope

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:41.380
Don't do this

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.300
They are right to fear me

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.400
I've seen evil

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:54.230
I'm looking at it now

00:02:09.319 --> 00:02:11.319
 

